WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:03.770
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.380
<i>One day, I was suddenly 
transported to another world,</i>

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.950
<i>where I ate some Fruit of Evolution</i>

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.360
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique.</i>

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.640
<i>But just moments later...</i>

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.110
I'm Saria.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.620
A gorilla?!

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.660
Marry me right now!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.290
<i>Marriage?!</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.790
<i>A kiss?!</i>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.160
<i>Turning into a woman?!</i>

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.670
Seiichi!

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.630
<i>Then our journey finally began!</i>

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.290
Welcome to the royal capital, Telbert!

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.180
<i>Or at least, it was supposed to begin.</i>

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.430
<i>But the people in this 
guild are too eccentric!</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.930
I'm Artoria, the Calamity.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.310
<i>My, what a babe! Wait, "Calamity"?!</i>

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.500
<i>A series of misfortunes 
followed us everywhere we went.</i>

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.520
<i>But thanks to my Evolution, 
I had no weaknesses!</i>

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:51.580
<i>I defeated the strongest monster, 
the Black Dragon God,</i>

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.350
<i>and then, yet another kiss?!</i>

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.660
<i>Then the gluttonous Lulune appeared!</i>

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.840
<i>We managed to seize victory 
at the Royal Cup, but then...</i>

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.660
Master!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.040
<i>...she transformed into a woman, too?!</i>

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.630
Hello!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.380
<i>What now?!</i>

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.000
<i>Arrested?!</i>

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.380
<i>An unbelievable turn of events 
brought me to Arkshell Castle.</i>

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.010
Now, here I come.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.600
<i>Wha... Louise-san?!</i>

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.730
May I call you Master?

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:27.550
<i>She became my apprentice?!</i>

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.110
<i>While I was panicking over that,</i>

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>the king was attacked by someone!</i>

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:36.030
<i>I managed to save him 
with Magic Creation...</i>

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.530
<i>but the king turned out to be Ranze-san?!</i>

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:46.040
<i>And now the interrogation of 
the assassin is about to begin.</i>

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.250
<i>So whether you've been watching all along 
or you're here for the first time,</i>

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>that's a brief summary of the plot so far,</i>

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:57.050
<i>so you can enjoy the story as it 
plunges into the final chapter!</i>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.220
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.220
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:32.390
<b>Creeping Kaiser Empire</b>

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:31.370
Would you just start talking already?

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:36.480
You don't want this to get 
painful, do you, young lady?

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.990
That's right. She's just getting started.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.600
Lorna's terrifying torture has yet to begin.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.740
Wh-What do you mean, "torture"?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.740
We've already got proof!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.750
This is the one measure 
I didn't want to resort to.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.760
Lorna, you're going to do <i>that</i>, aren't you?

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.760
Want a pork cutlet bowl?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.010
What is this, a cop drama?!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.420
Look at this piping hot steam,

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.290
these fluffy eggs,

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:21.280
and... this pork roast cutlet 
bursting with meat juice!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.030
Time to dig in!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.110
<i>You're</i> eating it?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.000
What a true shame!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.650
If you'd just start talking, you could 
be eating this great meal, too!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.300
Are you a demon?!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:47.330
Lorna.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.310
Y-Yes?! What brings you here, Louise-sama?!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.060
Why are you doing these things?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.380
I-I thought she'd cave in no time

00:04:55.380 --> 00:05:00.070
if I made her watch me eat something 
tasty while she's hungry!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.820
No dinner for you tonight.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.070
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why?!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.820
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.210
Here you go.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.710
I-I can have this?

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:22.210
You can eat as much as you want.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.520
Go on, don't hold back.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:30.720
It's good!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.100
Thank you for the meal.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.570
Now...

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:41.690
This collar is a magic item 
known as an Enslavement Collar.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:47.360
Those it's placed on are forced to obey any 
order from the one who placed it on them.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.370
So this collar is why this 
girl attacked Ranze-san?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.870
Yes, there's no doubt.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:58.370
If you knew that, then there 
was no need for interrogation!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.670
I'm sorry.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.380
I realized it after the fact.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:04.380
Then why don't we just remove the collar?

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.880
That's not possible.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:07.940
Huh?

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:19.140
This is the power of the Enslavement Collar.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.540
Who would do such a cruel thing?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.770
She failed?!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.070
W-Worry not.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:29.030
This is what we have the 
Enslavement Collars for.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.960
What are you going to do?

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.600
I'll make sure she upholds our secret orders.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.430
You mean you'll have her end her own life?

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.810
Indeed.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.170
Then order it at once!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.930
R-Right away!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:53.470
<i>Why do I wield my sword for this empire?</i>

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:58.430
<i>What is my sword actually protecting here?</i>

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.260
You're late.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.190
So you've finally come?

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:12.700
Are you the ruffian who plotted 
His Majesty's assassination?

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.080
I wondered who it might be,

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:20.080
and here I have the greatest knight, 
the King's Blade, Zakia-sama.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.330
Answer the question!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.640
That's right.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.820
I'm Shien, the one who shot His Majesty.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.590
Are you satisfied now?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.850
Why did you try to plunge 
this nation into chaos?!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.640
Chaos?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.100
It's long been in chaos, hasn't it?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.700
I won't have you saying you don't know!

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.370
You know what those of us 
in the populace go through!

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:49.650
Not that someone like you, who's been 
resting on his status, would understand!

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:52.280
However, my greatest reason...

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.110
was to avenge her.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.370
What are you talking about?

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.440
She was a demon.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:03.210
And for that reason alone, 
she was murdered like a bug.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.590
She never did anything wrong.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.790
She just worked as a florist.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.980
I want this!

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.590
Welcome.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.810
A demon selling flowers, huh?

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.290
U-Um...

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.060
Hmph, look at this crap.

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:20.940
S-Stop!

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.310
Please stop!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:37.570
Thanks to the official mandate to kill demons, 
we can finally exterminate these pests.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.580
N-Naturi!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.830
Y-You need to run...

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.670
Uh-oh.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.350
If we get any wetter than 
this, our armor will rust.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.390
C'mon, let's go.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.050
Naturiana! Naturiana!

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.350
Naturiana!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.950
That was when I made up my mind.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.610
I will never forgive those 
who laughed at her,

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.620
or this country that killed her!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:24.130
No matter what your reasons are,

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.620
I can't overlook anyone 
threatening the empire.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.870
Is that right?

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:33.380
So even the greatest knight 
is nothing but a puppet.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.880
I am no puppet!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.150
I want to protect this country! That is all!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.090
The Magic Gem Sword, Fiftia.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.400
Show me its power!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.410
<i>Where did it come from?!</i>

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.410
You look confused.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.640
But I'm not naïve enough to reveal my tricks.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.710
I'm not underestimating you, either.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.170
Thousand Arrow Prison!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.680
Now go down, King's Blade!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.420
Conquering Air Blast!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.190
What?!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.940
Surrender quietly.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.970
That's the King's Blade for you.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.850
We'll save this match for another time.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:44.610
Next time we meet, I pray 
you'll no longer be a puppet.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:45.720
Hold it!

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:47.710
Later, King's Blade.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.840
<i>A puppet...</i>

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.340
<i>They said it's impossible</i>

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:15.220
<i>for anyone but the one who attached an Enslavement Collar to remove it.</i>

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:18.740
<i>No magic to remove it exists, either.</i>

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:22.190
Seiichi! I heard from Claudia-san!

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:24.060
Sounds like a tough time...

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.240
Shh.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:29.040
<i>Then what if I do what 
I did to save Ranze-san?</i>

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.540
Skill: Magic Creation!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.550
Huh?

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.550
Uh, Master?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.070
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47.060
<i>Unlike with Get Better, I can't 
get a clear visual in mind!</i>

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.310
I-It's fine!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.670
I'm going to free you from this, okay?

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:55.560
Free?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:00.120
<i>Free... Enslavement... Slaves...</i>

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.700
<i>Speaking of freeing slaves,</i>

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.140
<i>there's that bearded guy...</i>

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:10.080
President Linc***!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:15.920
Huh?

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.660
Wh-Who's this?

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:24.090
President Linc***?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.720
Oh, no!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:35.730
Free! Free! Free!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.420
<i>Skill: Magic Creation activated.</i>

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:40.840
<i>Liberation Magic: 
President Linc*** has been created.</i>

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.610
No way!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.020
Th-The collar...

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.250
From now on, you're free!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.950
F-Free?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.640
Huh? Hey...

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.150
Oh, dear! What a bad man!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.260
Seiichi-san made a girl cry!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.480
D-Don't cry.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.600
There, there. It's okay.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.670
You're crying because 
you're happy, aren't you?

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:16.270
Uh-huh...

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:21.280
I can't believe someone used an 
Enslavement Collar on such a little girl.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:26.030
Of course she'd be happy after 
being freed from that, right?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.030
Man, this tastes great!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:33.080
I'm not following what's going 
on, but I'm happy for you!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.030
When did you go after the pork cutlet bowl?!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:39.040
I was saving that one!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.820
My name is Oliga Calmeria.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.210
As you can see, I'm a cat beastfolk.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.050
In the Kaiser Empire,

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.790
we beastfolk were persecuted.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.390
Bring out all but the beast kids!

00:13:58.390 --> 00:13:59.310
Sir!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.350
P-Please stop!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.120
Please, stop this!

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.080
Oliga! Oliga!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.500
My mother was carried off 
to a concentration camp.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.500
Please, don't torment the elderly...

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.570
Mommy! Mommy!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:20.210
All of the beastfolk children were sent 
to a facility to receive special training.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:23.810
There, we were trained to 
become killing machines.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.720
Can't you dodge any faster?!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:31.370
Those who survived became assassins.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:38.850
After that, I lived my life 
in the assassin squad,

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.480
serving the Kaiser Empire's royal family.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.800
Hm? That girl...

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.740
Are you lost, little girl?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:51.990
I'm sorry.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:58.620
Somebody help!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:08.620
Through that, I gained practical 
experience in the art of killing people.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:14.350
I've killed lots of people since the 
day that collar was placed on me.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.150
That was the only value I had.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:22.960
So my hands are completely stained.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.090
It's okay.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.280
You can start over, Oliga-chan.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.290
They're not completely stained.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:35.050
But I...

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:39.340
The Kaiser Empire is the evil here, not you.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.450
Beastfolk and humans are 
all people just the same.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.660
We all live life just the same.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.260
Really?

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:53.440
When I see you like this, 
you almost look like a little sister.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:55.980
Little sister...

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:58.810
Yeah.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:02.390
You can think of me as an 
older brother if you'd like.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:04.830
Hey, Seiichi!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:08.650
Can Oliga-chan stay with us, then?

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.400
That's a great idea!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.700
N-No!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.860
I'm a traitor.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.200
If I stay with you, the Kaiser 
Empire will come after you.

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:20.840
Then I'll protect you when they do.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:21.570
Huh?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:25.460
I'm pretty strong, even if I don't look it.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.460
B-But...

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.850
So there you have it.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.640
Is that okay, Louise?

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.810
That's fine. It's your decision, Master.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:36.470
You answered right away?!

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:42.170
I was originally hoping to leave 
her in your hands, anyway.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:47.120
Besides, His Majesty wishes 
to protect Oliga, as well.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.890
He said we couldn't punish 
such a young child.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.240
Ranze-san...

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:57.240
You mean it? I can?

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:58.880
Yeah!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.490
Nice to have you! I'm Hiiragi Seiichi!

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.340
Seiichi-oniichan...

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.050
Ah, it's you.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.060
What is the Demon Lord Army doing now?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.950
<i>There's nothing happening there!</i>

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:22.070
<i>We've needed to make major 
corrections to the plan.</i>

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:25.520
Yeah, the Demon Lord's daughter, Lutia,

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:30.850
proposed forging an alliance with 
the Kingdom of Wimberg.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.570
<i>That's right! Soon our dearest wish will be...</i>

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:39.060
Good. So how is the plan progressing?

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:42.830
I'm prepared to handle my part at any time.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:45.980
<i>Have a look at this!</i>

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.830
Wonderful.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:52.330
So shall we move things forward at once?

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:54.840
<i>Let's do it!</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.990
All is...

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.850
...for the Demon Lord!

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.850
<i>...for the Demon Lord!</i>

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:10.720
Okay, that's enough.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.860
I'm exhausted...

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:18.710
Yes, your control of magic 
is coming along smoothly.

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:21.620
I didn't think it would be this hard.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:25.250
You've made incredible progress 
since you first started.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.290
Huh? Hey... Seiichi-kun?!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.790
Wh-What do I do?!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:40.330
I never knew the beginner spell 
Water Ball could manifest like that.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.510
I'm sorry.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.180
Seiichi! Look at this!

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.180
Check out what I can do!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.190
Wow, you're both incredible!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.590
It's all thanks to your skill.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:18:59.940
Master...

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:05.550
Huh? You seem different from usual...

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.150
Actually, I have a favor to ask, Master.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.100
A favor?

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:17.960
While I'm away, would you 
please protect His Majesty?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:22.220
Protect Ranze-san? Where are you going?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.050
Do you remember the Black Paladin?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.970
Yeah, if I recall, he's the 
only knight in this country

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:32.850
who's capable of holding his own against you.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:35.090
We received a report from him

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:40.390
saying that monsters have been growing 
more active along our borders as of late.

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:47.220
Apparently, the Black Paladin's 
army isn't enough on its own,

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:51.760
so I'll be leading the Valkyries there.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:56.940
If you could protect him 
in my absence, Master,

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.130
I'm sure His Majesty 
would rest easy, as well.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.800
Uh, but... I'm a mere adventurer.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:08.510
A mere adventurer could never have
defeated me, the Knight of Swords.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.640
Right. Sorry.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.430
Will you accept?

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:16.650
All right. If you think I'm worthy.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.330
Thank you so much!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:23.160
Now, I have preparations to 
make, so I'll excuse myself.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.480
<i>She has it rough leading the Valkyries, too.</i>

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:38.930
All right, Master, I'll be counting on you 
to take care of things in my absence.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.040
I'll do my best.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:45.430
Louise-san, when do you 
expect you'll be returning?

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:51.560
We don't plan on taking our time, but it 
takes at least a week to travel there.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.810
That's pretty far away!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:57.170
Once we defeat the monsters, 
there'll still be aftermath to deal with.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:00.890
Considering all that, 
it might take over a month.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.570
That's pretty long...

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.990
Louise-sama!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.590
All of the Valkyries are prepared for departure!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.120
Thank you.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:14.830
Now, Master, everyone, we're heading out!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.650
Take care!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.180
See you later!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.210
Move out!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.290
<i>But I would later learn...</i>

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:32.470
<i>that nothing in this world 
ever goes that smoothly.</i>

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:38.580
<i>But I wouldn't realize that until 
a week after their departure.</i>

