00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:14.820
Time for "Seiichi-oniichan's Status for Today"!

00:23:14.820 --> 00:23:17.550
Want to eat the ultimate roast beef bowl?

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:22.990
Don't mind if I do!

00:23:24.350 --> 00:23:26.760
Hey! This wasn't the deal!

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:29.740
