00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:30.490
Yep.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.730
They packed too much in!

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:38.850
The grand battle against 
the monsters finally begins!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:40.230
